id: DRAFT-libleidenalg-0.9.0-igraph-1.0-api-migration
title: libleidenalg 0.9.0 igraph 0.10→1.0 API 迁移 + CMakeDeps 同主版本闸 + FILE_SET 漏头补偿
category: cmake, conan, dependency, api-migration
severity: 2
trigger_tool: conan|cmake|clang
phase: configuration|compilation|testing
doc_file: DRAFT-libleidenalg-0.9.0-igraph-1.0-api-migration.md
library: libleidenalg
version: "0.9.0"
build_system: cmake

error_signature: |
  Could not find a configuration file for package "igraph" that is compatible
  with requested version "0.10"|
  no matching function for call to 'igraph_neighbors'|
  no matching function for call to 'igraph_incident'|
  fatal error: 'LinearResolutionParameterVertexPartition.h' file not found

match_keywords: >
  igraph, CMakeDeps, config-version, same major, find_package version floor,
  igraph_neighbors, igraph_incident, IGRAPH_LOOPS_TWICE, multiple, loops,
  FILE_SET headers, includedirs, sibling include, angle-bracket

root_cause: |
  (1) Conan 2 CMakeDeps 生成的 igraph-config-version.cmake 做"同主版本"校验
  (PACKAGE_FIND_VERSION_MAJOR STREQUAL CVF_VERSION_MAJOR)，上游
  find_package(igraph 0.10) 的 major=0 与在仓 igraph/1.0.0 的 major=1 不匹配，
  1.0.0 > 0.10 仍被拒。
  (2) igraph 1.0 对 igraph_neighbors/igraph_incident 签名扩展
  (新增 loops/multiple 参数)，0.10 时代 4 参调用编译失败。
  (3) 上游 include/CMakeLists.txt 的 FILE_SET headers 漏列
  LinearResolutionParameterVertexPartition.h，且公开头互相尖括号同级包含，
  消费者缺 -I<prefix>/include/libleidenalg 时找不到同级头。

rec_approach: patch-drop-find-package-version-floor + igraph-1.0-signature-adaptation + file-set-header-compensation
rec_description: |
  1) patches 0001: find_package(igraph 0.10 CONFIG REQUIRED) -> find_package(igraph CONFIG REQUIRED)，
  绕开 CMakeDeps 同主版本闸（目标库 API 与 1.x 兼容时）。
  2) patches 0003: igraph_incident(g,e,v,mode,IGRAPH_LOOPS_TWICE)；
  igraph_neighbors(g,n,v,mode,IGRAPH_LOOPS_TWICE,true)，等价保留 0.10 语义。
  3) patches 0002: FILE_SET headers 补 LinearResolutionParameterVertexPartition.h。
  4) package_info(): cpp_info.includedirs=["include","include/libleidenalg"]，
  CMakeDeps 目标同时携带 <prefix>/include 与 <prefix>/include/libleidenalg。
verification_cmd: |
  python3 scripts/ohc-run.py conan-verify libleidenalg 0.9.0
  # 通过后 test_package ./test_leidenalg 6/6 PASS，W3 build_and_test.sh 1/1 100%
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual-patches-and-package-info

affected_scope: |
  CMake+Conan 库在在仓依赖为大版本升级（igraph 1.0.0）而目标库仍为旧 API
  世代时的 find_package 版本下限、依赖 API 签名迁移、公开头 FILE_SET 安装
  清单与同级尖括号包含的配方补偿。

principles:
  - P012
  - P014

severity_code: 2
draft: true
status: pending-editor-review
